WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
You don't have to change your brain to start observing it.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:14.000
A short practice can fit a real day.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:21.000
Notice the difference between what happened and what you believe happened.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:28.000
The science of perception is fascinating; it does not prove a branded audio result.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:35.000
Try the free routine, then ask whether a structured recording suits you.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:42.000
Read the evidence and the buying questions before you decide.
